            "review_title": "Review at OSO Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nGreat views of the tail-end of Dragon Bridge and worthy of being a lunch spot where you can enjoy the bustle of Da Nang.\nJan 2023 • Solo\nSome tasty food options. They’re trying to be a bit more than just a casual eatery.\n\nGreat views of the tail-end of Dragon Bridge and worthy of being a lunch spot where you can enjoy the bustle of Da Nang.\n\nFood is so-so. Might be a good breakfast spot. A lot of the items on the menu were 86ed.\n\nFront cooler case looks like storage and therefore not appealing.\n\nMuffins are packaged for children. Hey! I’m an adult and would like to have a muffin too! (They were good.).\n\nWould I go back? Possibly if it’s a nice day and I want to enjoy the view. I wouldn’t go out of my way.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 28, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
